                                "sense_id": "443acf39-a94e-31b5-9f71-a7112653d937",
                                "text": "An olla (which literally means “pot”) is a round, unglazed terra cotta clay pot with a long neck that you fill with water and bury next to your plants. It irrigates in the ground."
